@host = http://localhost:5073

### List all products
GET {{host}}/api/products

### Get one product (404 if it does not exist)
GET {{host}}/api/products/1

### Create a product
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Keyboard","price":49.99}

### Create with invalid data (returns 400 with validation errors)
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"","price":-1}

### Upload an image for product 1 (any file works; this sends README.web-api-controllers.md)
POST {{host}}/api/products/1/image
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="readme.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ../../README.web-api-controllers.md
--boundary--

### Delete a product (204, then 404 if repeated)
DELETE {{host}}/api/products/1

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
